<span id="A4.SS3.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A4.SS3.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS3.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question:<span id="A4.SS3.p4.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> A renowned film from the last century, adapted from a film literary script whose title (different from the film title) contains numbers. After more than 60 years, it was restored and re-screened. The film’s director worked as a teacher with a four-character female actress in southwestern China during the 1930s-40s. What is the birth place of this female actress? 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.SS3.p4.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p">
<span id="A4.SS3.p4.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle" style="width:434.7pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6FF;">
